WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Adding a character card does not need JAR or JAR Bridge.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
On Home, choose 2. Add a card. The regular importer opens.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose card files, then select a downloaded PNG, JSON or CHARX card.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Check the import queue. Choose Import to save the character.

5
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.600
After the import succeeds, Open character shows its profile.
